  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The average kinetic energy of a monatomic molecule is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn><mo> </mo><mi>eV</mi></math> at temperature:</p><p>(Use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>"
  },
